WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.770
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.740
Okay, babies!

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.120
This is Halloween!

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.700
Tonight is Halloween!

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.960
Normally, this would call for costumed children parading door to door,

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:29.210
offering neighbors a choice of trick or treat, {only using this here for convenience, they say both types later on}

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:33.760
but Halloween night at Four Star Academy is a bit different!

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:38.760
Our first-years get to go around getting candy from their upperclassmen and teachers!

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.310
That sounds like fun!

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:41.600
Awesome!

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.140
That gets me fun!{fine, but uh}

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.270
And this year, taking inspiration from a widely loved picture book,

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.270
we've made the theme Halloween Magic!

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:58.450
The student who collects the most candy will be crowned Halloween Princess, so get out and get on it!

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:06.370
However, you're in for a big surprise if you think it'll be a walk in the park.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:52.190
Koharu-chan, your costume is just too wonderful!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:56.070
Thanks, I'm supposed to be a fairy. What are you?

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:58.030
An apprentice witch!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.780
You look adorable.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.910
Oh, that's right. We're supposed to visit all the spots on this map

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.290
and collect as much candy as we can.

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.920
Come to think of it, Rola was supposed to join us.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.210
I wonder if it's taking her a while to change.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.420
Sorry I'm late!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.420
Rola?!

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.970
What are you wearing?

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.840
What do you mean? It's my Halloween cosplay.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.430
The title of Halloween Princess will be mine.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:30.060
Don't think it'll be that easy.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:34.810
The one to gather the most candy will be none other than I, Saotome Ako!

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.400
Ako-chan, your costume's so cute!

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.110
What's this, the real Ako kitty? {should be Ako-kitty?}{I think this fines}

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:45.030
I-In any case, I won't be losing this competition.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.370
Mahiru, Tamaki, are we clear?

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:50.040
Yeah, let's all do our best.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.790
And get the candy!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.790
Mahiru-chan, Tamaki-chan, you're both so cute!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:04:00.170
It's time to go trick-or-treating! Let's play some pranks!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.550
Yeah!

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.470
It's Halloween everywhere you look.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.100
I can tell we're going to make a lot of fun memories.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.060
Yeah, that's right.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.560
Where should we start?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:18.820
The closest location is the Dress Make room.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.030
Huh?

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:28.490
It's pitch black.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:35.710
Welcome, ladies of the first year.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:40.590
We are the mysterious pretty guardians, The Admins!{excellent choice of uh, words}

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:41.340
Flash!

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.090
Gleam!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.340
Shine! {I dunno man}{these are definitely okay words, though not excellent like the other ones}

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.180
Um, anyway!

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.060
Trick or treat!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.480
Give us candy or we'll play a prank on you!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:56.230
Oh, is it candy that you desire?

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.480
In that case...

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.980
You can have it!

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.490
It's not right to waste food like that!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.620
Wait a second.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:11.160
If you look closely, it isn't candy at all.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.450
What?!

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:16.500
These are just fakes made by wrapping styrofoam in foil!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:21.630
And aren't these milk cartons rolled up to look like candy?

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.880
Idols are environmentally friendly!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:27.130
The real candy is up here.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.890
If you want to get your hands on it...

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.510
Try and make it up here!

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.140
We can't get any closer like this.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.900
You've got me going!

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.480
Felicitai-tai! Felicitai-tai!

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.530
Felicitai-tai! Felicitai-tai!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.820
She's sending the candy flying!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.160
Inconceivable!

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.410
How can she spin so quickly on one leg?!

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:55.910
Now's the time to show you the finely honed sense of balance I polished through my Aikatsu!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.500
Felicitai! Felicitai!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.290
Felicitai-tai!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.710
Rola...

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.920
Amazing! She's climbing the stairs while fending off the candy barrage!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.800
Felicitai-tai! Felicitai-tai!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:11.180
Felicitai-tai! Felicitai-tai!

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:13.680
Ow! Ow!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.690
Now, trick or treat!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:24.360
C-Congratulations...

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.070
The candy is yours.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.740
If you wanna get all the candy,

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.870
you've gotta go with Rola.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.080
Create your own miracle!

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:37.080
Miracle!

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:39.040
Felicitai-tai!

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.430
So where should we start?

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.340
Let me think...

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:55.010
Tick tick tick tick...

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.470
Ding-dong!

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:59.390
According to my brain database,{assuming you didn't undo my changes from the last time}{damn, you remembered}

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:04.860
the most efficient course of action is to begin with the mini-theater the teachers are waiting at.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:11.990
Welcome, babies.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.740
It's Halloween! Let's dance!

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:20.830
Trick or treat!

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.960
I-If you don't give us candy...

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.630
We'll prank you!

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:27.250
Goodness, how scary.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.670
We have all the candy you could want right here.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.510
Take as much as you can.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.390
Okay!

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.770
Allow me, Saotome Ako, to take the lead!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.400
The floor is moving!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.030
Well now, do you think you can reach the candy?

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.540
This is impossible!

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:06.170
With all of the skills you've gained through your Aikatsu, this should pose no obstacle.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.960
Even if you say that...{this is fine but only because I have a sentimental attachment to this phrasing}

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.300
Mahiru?

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.430
Aikatsu. Aikatsu.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.810
Woo!

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.930
What is going on here?

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:25.940
That is the applied moonwalk!

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:30.820
The moonwalk is originally a technique in which your feet appear to be moving forward,

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:34.820
while in reality you actually slide yourself backwards!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:39.330
But why would that allow you to go against the flow of a conveyor belt?

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:43.330
For it is her will to move forward despite facing backwards!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:46.000
She embodies the Aikatsu strength of mind!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:51.210
Yes! Kasumi Mahiru is moving on now!{I see}

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.430
As expected of Kasumi Mahiru!{yay, it's all my favorite stock translations}

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.090
Logic does not apply to her.

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.720
Very impressive.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.970
Aikatsu, Aikatsu, Aikatsu...

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:06.100
Trick or treat!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.860
Excellently done, baby!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:13.490
We reward your efforts with this special giant chocolate.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:15.360
Thank you!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.780
It can't be!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:26.830
Y-You may have gotten a giant chocolate bar,
but it doesn't even fit in your bag.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.920
How are you going to fare with that slowing you down?

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.740
Come on, there's much to be done.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.490
R-Right...

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:02.450
Where are we stopping next?

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.290
Let's see, the next closest is...

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.870
This room...

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.500
Yeah, let's not.

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.590
Good plan. It's kind of scary anyway.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:26.810
How unfortunate. If nothing changes...

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:31.270
I'll end up with all this candy, roar.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:47.250
E-Excuse me, trick or treat...

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.670
Shakespeare once said,

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:57.510
"Refrain tonight, and that shall lend a kind of easiness

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:02.760
to the next abstinence, the next more easy." {I THINK this is right. It's from Hamlet}{sounds about right}

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:08.390
U-Um, trick or treat, please.

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:13.150
Such a wonderful night is tonight.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:17.900
On any other, none dare to enter my castle. {but Yume...}

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:23.410
What a pleasure to gaze upon my festive guests.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.790
It's cold...

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:33.580
It's freezing. Mahiru, I'm amazed you can stand it.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.420
She's frozen solid!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:46.100
Allow me to recite from the Les Propheties of Nostradamus next.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.860
Now then, it's finally time.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:11:59.690
We're here!

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:02.820
The spot where all of S4 is!

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:08.200
Hime-senpai and the others are all kind, 
so I bet we'll be able to get tons of candy!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.450
I hope they have sour konbu too.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:12.460
Y-Yeah, me too...

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.460
Let's get to it!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.000
Yeah!

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.510
We are witches.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.390
The Four Stars spreading trickery through the land.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.270
Tirelessly serving as shining beacons in the sky.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.730
The radiance of witches is...

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:36.980
Eternal!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.860
They don't seem very kind today.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:40.730
Yeah.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:45.240
U-Um, Senpai. Trick or treat.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.450
If it's candy you want...

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.870
Simply try...

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.990
To avoid all our magic.

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:52.870
Magi-magi Cal-cal!

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.540
Magical Trick!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.000
Make everyone pumpkinheads!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:05.510
Where is I? Who am this?

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.010
Don't tell me this is real magic!

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.890
No, look over there!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.770
What's going on?

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.400
This is nothing! Felicitai-tai!

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.150
Rola, above you!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.660
Looks like vertical attacks are your weakness.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.660
Even Rola... Wh-What should I do?

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:39.290
An idol is like the light of a star shining in darkness.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:44.920
A glimmer formed by the gathering of many smaller lights.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:50.800
You should have collected countless tiny lights 
throughout your life. If you can find the right one...

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:53.560
You might be able to make it through!

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.310
<i>Throughout my life...</i>

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.280
I know! This is it!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:04.860
Receive!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.860
Oh my!

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:09.110
Set!

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:10.120
Oh no!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:12.990
Spike!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:15.160
Time to get punished?!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:20.540
Aikatsu! Aikatsu Attack!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.800
Wonderful, Yume-chan!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.050
I did it!

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:33.600
It's time, S4! Trick or treat!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.390
Yume-chan, did you figure it out?

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:42.230
Each of your memories may be a small light by itself...

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:47.150
But put them together, and they become a shining star that illuminates the darkness.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:55.910
To put it simply, we're trying to say that there's no such thing as a worthless experience in life.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:15:00.170
Right! Thank you for the lesson!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.300
I think we've hit up most of the spots by now.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.010
Yeah, probably.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.680
Huh? Where did Koharu-chan go?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.180
Wait for me!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:18.680
Huh? You're still wearing that Jack-o'-lantern?

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.190
Why don't you take it off?

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:23.520
Well, I actually kind of like it.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.570
More importantly,

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:28.440
you haven't gotten any candy at all, Koharu.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:33.200
Don't worry, that's okay. 
I'll share half of mine with you to eat.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.120
Thanks!

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:38.290
I don't mean for eating, but for the Halloween Princess.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.790
I almost forgot.

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.750
Well, well. Now, now.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.710
Oh, Ako-chan. Did you guys get your candy?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.210
O-Of course we did.

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:53.180
It looks like Mahiru's the only one carrying a bag.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.680
This chocolate's pretty good.

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:59.100
What is it, Tamaki?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.350
There's this small circle we overlooked on the map.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:05.610
Could it be a secret point? {doesn't look hidden to me}

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:08.150
This is my chance for a comeback!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:10.110
Wait, Ako-chan!

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:17.870
If I were a candy, I would cover you with my sweet embrace.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:20.120
The cream puff, Yuuki Subaru!

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:24.960
A fluffy texture that's light, sweet, and white!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.130
Marshmallow boy, Kasumi Asahi!{wasn't that a—wait, that's marmalade boy}

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:30.880
I'll melt your body and heart with my sweetness.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.510
The traditional prince, Igarashi Nozomu. {that's not a food}

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.640
A cool and bitter black chocolate.

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:39.510
That would be I, Kira Kanata.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.520
S-Subaru-kyun!

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:47.480
Now then, lovely ladies. {not in the hime-sama way, of course}

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:51.280
What tricks will you surprise us with tonight?

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:54.320
Be warned that we have harsh standards.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:58.030
Hey, why aren't you in a boiled octopus costume, Nijino? {what do you think of updating}{this is approve}

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.660
I'm leaving.

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:06.330
Wait, wait, just hang on! If you leave now, Koharu won't be able to get any!

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:07.670
But...

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.300
T-Trick or treat!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.670
I'm a scary, scary Cat Sidhe!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:17.300
Won't you make a contract with the devil?

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:20.260
Bark! Bark! Bark! I'm a werewolf, bark!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.680
I'll bite you if you don't give me candy!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.190
It's kind of lacking.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.070
Lacking?

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:36.450
Let's give this a shot! You too, Koharu!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.200
O-Okay!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.200
Trick or treat!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.910
I'm a pumpkin!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:45.330
If you don't give us candy, I'll cast a nasty spell on you!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:53.710
I'll say it straight. The best I can give you is a five out of a hundred.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:59.050
That's why I said you should've been an octopus.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:03.560
Now you're looking boiled.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:06.230
All right, that's worth one chocolate.{isn't it unfair that she gets candy just because he likes her}

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.230
Just one?

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:19.610
Lacking... Subaru-kyun thinks I'm lacking...

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:26.250
By the way, is that Nanakura Koharu-chan inside that pumpkin?

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.870
Oh, yes.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:31.330
Don't you think you'd look better without that on your head?

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.300
Huh? But I...

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:37.840
Your fairy outfit is cute too. 
You should make the most of it.

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:41.510
You think so? The pumpkinhead thing seems cute to me.

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:42.930
Cute?!

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:48.390
Koharu! Hand that pumpkin to me right this instant!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.390
Ako-chan!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.270
Don't be so rough!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.900
My glasses! My glasses!

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:01.910
<i>Will Koharu-chan's true face finally be revealed?</i>

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:07.660
Trick or treat!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.460
Koharu?!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.670
When did you put those on?

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:18.300
I was planning to surprise you two with them later.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.800
That's our living grab bag, Koharu-chan!

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:25.680
M-Mustache... a mustached fairy...

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:30.690
Huh? D-Did I go too far?

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.190
Nii-san...

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:37.980
Nice one!

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:39.650
You're so funny!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.700
That's a hundred twenty points.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.450
Thank you!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.030
Koharu-chan.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:47.290
Yume-chan?

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:48.370
Here.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.700
Thanks!

00:19:55.670 --> 00:20:01.970
Okay, let's present Nanakura Koharu with candy for giving us a nice surprise!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:03.890
Here you go.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:03.890
Take these.

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:04.720
Here.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:08.850
You did it!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.600
That's awesome, Koharu!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:27.740
At the end of the night, this year's Halloween Princess is none other than Nanakura Koharu!

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.830
Congratulations, Koharu-chan.

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:41.260
I knew my eyes didn't deceive me.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:45.010
Thank you so much, Yozora-senpai!

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:48.470
I didn't expect her to turn it all around at the eleventh hour.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.310
Nice work, Koharu-chan.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.770
That's our girl.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:56.770
Nanakura Koharu! What a frightful girl!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:04.530
That was so much fun.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:06.700
Koharu one-upped all of us today.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:07.780
You exaggerate.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:13.410
S-So hey, since we're all in costume, why don't we take a photo to remember tonight by?

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:15.040
Good idea!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.750
You've got me going!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:18.420
Hold it!

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:21.170
How dare you forget about your best friend!

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:27.430
It's blasphemy to leave the photogenic Ako-sama out of your picture!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:31.180
Did you really just call yourself photogenic?

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:33.640
And Koharu is <i>my</i> best friend.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.310
Hey...

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:39.690
Since it's Halloween and all, can we get in on the pic too?

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:41.610
Of course!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.070
Okay, babies!

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:49.070
I'll take the photo for you. Everyone crowd together.

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.450
Come on, squeeze in tight!

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:53.830
Anna-sensei!

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:57.330
Yay! Thank you!

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:59.830
Here we go!

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:01.670
All together!

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:04.090
Aikatsu!

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:14.060
I don't think I'll ever forget this wonderful night.

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:19.980
It will forever be one of the 
tiny glimmers that we call a memory.

00:24:10.590 --> 00:24:13.390
I swear I won't lose to Yume this time.

00:24:13.390 --> 00:24:16.010
This fight decides the best Song Class first-year!

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:19.220
That makes this a battle for the center!

00:24:19.220 --> 00:24:21.430
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:21.430 --> 00:24:22.640
True Rivals.

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:24.730
Become the first-star idol!
